      "content": "Feeling like a ghost does not mean your soul is gone, but rather that you are carrying a pain so heavy it has dulled the color of your world. While this numbness protects you, it does not mean the exhaustion is without a way out; please share these feelings with a trusted friend or a professional who can help you process this hollow ache. You are still here, and healing even in small, quiet steps can slowly bring your \"me\" back.",
